					"content": "But, Lupical also...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100080604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Razor"
				},
				{
					"id": 100080604,
					"content": "We're here because we care about you, just like you do us! That's what makes us Lupical, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100080605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
